# Whitelist, per rgbcu.be/blog/gitignore: ignore everything, re-include by name.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md

# Shell, ghostty and sudo-askpass moved to ../nixos-config (home-manager). What
# stays below is only what home-manager can't own (daemon/app-rewritten files).

# Claude Code config: a copy from ~/.claude (settings + user skills only;
# never deployed back over a live ~/.claude)
!.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

!Library/
!Library/Preferences/
!Library/Preferences/com.apple.Terminal.plist
